–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 11.5.2 (Stephan)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"260–261"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"280–281"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PADegree}\">\\(\\operatorname{PADegree}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing^{\\prime}\">\\(\\varnothing^{\\prime}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"15f1f418de3165e2\" href=\"?note=15f1f418de3165e2\" title=\"43-df-pa-degree\">43-df-pa-degree</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\land\\operatorname{PADegree}(X)\\Rightarrow\\varnothing^{\\prime}\\le_TX.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\land\\operatorname{PADegree}(X)\\Rightarrow\\varnothing^{\\prime}\\le_TX.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是计算停机集的下界，不能把结论写成X与停机集等价；X可具有更高的随机度。原书以部分二值函数扩张和小测度类证明，核对了陈述与方向，未独立重证整个构造。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所供2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 11.5.2 (Stephan)；印刷页260–261，PDF页280–281。本轮逐项核对来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pa-degree","status":"resolved","id":"15f1f418de3165e2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pa-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\operatorname{PADegree}$、$\\le_T$、$\\varnothing^{\\prime}$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-pa-degree]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-jump]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pa-degree","status":"resolved","id":"15f1f418de3165e2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\operatorname{PADegree}$、$\\le_T$、$\\varnothing^{\\prime}$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-pa-degree]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-jump]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":